% formalizes: claim:lib-7d
% fidelity: strained — "fines exceed the limit" is a sum; over_limit(M) is given. "May still return items and keep their holds" is read as: being over the limit cancels no hold.
may_borrow(M) :- member(M), not over_limit(M).
bottom :- over_limit(M), hold_member(H, M), cancelled_for_fines(H).
